  bx('bl', "<b>Slide map (class slides):</b> Lecture 29: 19 chapter board, 20 rupees vs value, 21 Drain and Swaraj, 22 Drain-of-wealth question, 23 answer frame, 26 communal veto, 32 industrial GDP, 33 crops, 34 machine goods, 35 transport, 37 rail-road-port, 39 components, 40 tariffs, 41 exchange rate, 42 monetary-fiscal, 44 Council Bills, 45-46 Home Charges. Lecture 30: 1-2 Home Charges, 3 FDI became FD, 4 double drain, 5 CB four arrows, 13 PYQ 1996, 15-16 AINLF, 23-24 Knighthood, 25 and 27 PYQ 2011, 32 PYQ 2018, 34 PYQ 2020. Sections 1 (nation building) and 3.2 (architects) carry the people PYQs."),
